{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, then move, approach, take or check it, and finally do specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectReachable    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectTakeable    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    />",
